{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/extras/4844e7ccbef16f9f1b2de7c1c70f3ed7.poster.avif?t=1761998231\" width=800 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/extras/4844e7ccbef16f9f1b2de7c1c70f3ed7.webm?t=1761998231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/extras/4844e7ccbef16f9f1b2de7c1c70f3ed7.mp4?t=1761998231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Dingir OS \u2013 the finest and only operating system that includes everything you need to explore the Deep Web.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a closed system created by the netstalker group NOOSPHERE, it is now available to you! Inside, you'll find not only engaging programs for surfing the darkest corners of the network but also diaries of group members, voice recordings, and even digital artifacts collected by netstalkers over many years years years years of research!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/extras/9f78738ebc044be02358a76fab7fa4eb.poster.avif?t=1761998231\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/extras/9f78738ebc044be02358a76fab7fa4eb.webm?t=1761998231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please treat the contents of this OS with the utmost seriousness. We cannot guarantee your safety. Everything inside is to be explored at your own peril.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/extras/7df8357e6ab504619ce82f74cc2a7566.poster.avif?t=1761998231\" width=798 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/extras/7df8357e6ab504619ce82f74cc2a7566.webm?t=1761998231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/extras/7df8357e6ab504619ce82f74cc2a7566.mp4?t=1761998231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A short interactive horror story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Point-and-click interface</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Mini-games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Deep lore of netstalker culture</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A multimedia library of terrifying files</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3996450?t=1761998231","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3996450?t=1761998231","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/517fba0a76745aebeec23b6a220d728f98b50ac9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761998231","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996450/517fba0a76745aebeec23b6a220d728f98b50ac9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761998231","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content"},"demos":[{"appid":4119450,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted l